guide forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed
title Warlock Felsteed
category Collectibles
folder Mounts · Class
keywords Summon Felsteed, Strahad Farsan, Ratchet, Warlock, class mount
class Warlock
levels 40-60
zone The Barrens

# Summon Felsteed: your class trainer's hand-off to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (Mount: the spell
# is still a Forever mount; ItemSparse); quests.json and npcs.json for the
# chain.
# The hand-off quest comes from the warlock trainers of Stormwind (Humans),
# Ironforge (Gnomes), Orgrimmar (Orcs, Trolls) and the
# Undercity (Undead).

step Summon Felsteed (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 40 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.
  level 40
  accept 4488

step Summon Felsteed (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 40 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.
  level 40
  accept 4487

step Summon Felsteed (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 40 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.
  level 40
  accept 3631

step Summon Felsteed (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 40 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar.
  level 40
  accept 4489

step Strahad Farsan in Ratchet
  zone The Barrens
  tip Ratchet is on the Barrens coast east of the Crossroads; from the Alliance side, take the boat from Booty Bay. Strahad Farsan's follow-up teaches Summon Felsteed.
  turnin 4488 only Human
  turnin 4487 only Gnome
  turnin 3631 only Orc,Troll
  turnin 4489 only Undead
  accept 4490
  turnin 4490
  learn 5784 "Summon Felsteed"
